@startuml
!include ../../../images/common-sequence.iuml

title Controller-to-Controller Provisioning — SoftAP Flow

actor User

box "Target Controller (ESP32)" $OnPrem
    participant "Target\nFirmware" as Target
end box

box "Source Controller (ESP32)" $OnPrem
    participant "SoftAP\n(SSID: FireFly-Provisioning)" as AP
    participant "HTTP API" as API
end box

User -> API++ : **Enable Provisioning Mode**\nPUT /api/provisioning\n""{visual-token}""

break visual-token Invalid
    API --> User : HTTP 401
end

API --> User : HTTP 202
API -> AP-- : **Start SoftAP**\nWPA2 password = ""nibble-interleave(BSSID)""\nTX power = ""2 dBm""\nmax clients = ""1""


Target -> Target : **Boot — check for own config file**\nLittleFS: ""/controllers/{uuid}""
Target -> Target : **Config missing — scan for SSID**\n"""FireFly-Provisioning""" (exact)
Target -> Target : **Read BSSID from scan result**\ncompute password = ""nibble-interleave(BSSID)""
Target -> AP++ : **Connect using WPA2**\nwith computed password (10 s timeout)

break MAC not in allowlist
    AP -> API : **Rogue client event**
    API -> API : **Shut down SoftAP**
    AP --> Target-- : Disconnect
    Target -> Target : **Continue unprovisioned**
end

AP --> Target-- : Connected (DHCP 192.168.4.x)

Target -> API++ : **Get nonce**\nGET /api/provisioning/nonce

break Request is not from SoftAP
    API --> Target: HTTP 403
end

break Provisioning mode inactive
    API --> Target: HTTP 409
end

API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{ "nonce": 3819273645 }""

Target -> API++ : **Get provisioning bundle**\nGET /api/provisioning/controller\n""mac-address: aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff"" (own WiFi MAC)\n""x-nonce: 3819273645""

break Request is not from SoftAP
    API --> Target: HTTP 403
end

break Provisioning mode inactive
    API --> Target: HTTP 409
end

API -> API : **Validate nonce**\nunused, matches session

break Nonce used or invalid
    API --> Target: HTTP 401
end

API -> API : **Find controller record by ""mac-address""**

break No controller with ""mac-address""
    API --> Target: HTTP 404
    Target -> Target : **Continue unprovisioned**
end

API -> API : **Invalidate nonce**
API --> Target-- : HTTP 200\n""{ "controllers": [...], "clients": [...] }""

Target -> Target : **Write each controller record**\nencrypted to LittleFS: ""/controllers/{uuid}""
Target -> Target : **Write each client record**\nencrypted to LittleFS: ""/clients/{uuid}""
Target -> Target : **Reboot into normal mode**

User -> API++ : **Disable Provisioning Mode**\nDELETE /api/provisioning\n""{visual-token}""
API --> User : HTTP 202
API -> AP-- : **Shut down SoftAP**

@enduml
